        <mxCell id="Eh0DZUCQheAy16XRewN5-9" value="&lt;div&gt;1. When &lt;b&gt;all predictors are potentially useful&lt;/b&gt; but multicollinearity is present.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. When you want to &lt;b&gt;regularize the model without variable selection&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;spacingTop=0;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
